## SQ-STK-01 | stack sizes applied, no missing dict key
@group A
@commands Boot; `grep -nE "\[stack_sizes\]\|no item_dict key" logs/latest.log logs/kubejs/startup.log \| head`
@pass `set 1398 stack sizes` (the entries of `stack_sizes.json`, regenerated 2026-11-06 and 2026-11-11: 515 x 8, 53 x 16, 434 x 32, 396 x 64; was 1341), no `no item_dict key` warning
@fails count differs: the JSON in the instance is not the regenerated one
@from batches/r1102b/s3_A.qb passed
@reviewed 2026-11-20
# r1120lr batch fault: stale count 1341; the boot set 1398 with no warning
bootexpect \[stack_sizes\] set 1398 stack sizes
bootreject no item_dict key
kjsreject no item_dict key

## SQ-STK-02 | food stack sizes 32 (desserts, sweets)
@group A
@commands `/dumpstacks` (or `/kubejs hand` per item): `fruitsdelight:pear_with_rock_sugar`, `apple_jello`, `hamimelon_shaved_ice`, `mangosteen_cake`, `berry_good:glowgurt`, `incubation:scrambled_eggs`, `farmersdelight:dog_food`, `veggiesdelight:sweet_potato_pancakes`
@pass 32 each
@fails rule order in `gen_stack_sizes.py`
@reviewed 2026-11-16
@from batches/r1102b/s3_A.qb passed
> cdevtest item fruitsdelight:pear_with_rock_sugar
> cdevtest item fruitsdelight:apple_jello
> cdevtest item fruitsdelight:hamimelon_shaved_ice
> cdevtest item fruitsdelight:mangosteen_cake
> cdevtest item berry_good:glowgurt
> cdevtest item incubation:scrambled_eggs
> cdevtest item farmersdelight:dog_food
> cdevtest item veggiesdelight:sweet_potato_pancakes
count verb=item item=\S+ .*max_stack=32\b == 8
reject \[cdevtest\] .*done=0

