## SQ-STK-06 | Syrup stacks to 64; 3 cucumbers + 2 zucchini + salt pickle; cabbage cutting gives 4 leaves
@group A
@commands `/kubejs hand` on Rustic Delight Syrup; in the Pickling Jar put 3 cucumbers + 2 zucchini + salt
@pass Syrup max stack 64; the jar offers 5 Pickles (zucchini accepted in every cucumber slot); cabbage on a board gives 4 leaves
@fails pickle recipe or syrup size wrong
@reviewed 2026-11-16
@from batches/r1113/c1_a1.qb
> cdevtest item rusticdelight:syrup
expect verb=item item=rusticdelight:syrup .*max_stack=64\b
> cdevtest rdetail pickle_from_fermenting
expect verb=rdetail id=\S*pickle_from_fermenting serializer=vintagedelight:fermenting result=\S*pickle\*5\b ingredients=\S*(vintagedelight:cucumber/veggiesdelight:zucchini|veggiesdelight:zucchini/vintagedelight:cucumber)
> cdevtest rdetail farmersdelightcutting/cabbage_leaves
expect verb=rdetail id=\S*farmersdelightcutting/cabbage_leaves serializer=farmersdelight:cutting result=\S*cabbage_leaf\*4\b
reject \[cdevtest\] .*done=0
look the jar half (3 cucumbers + 2 zucchini + salt in the jar at 1000 -60 1009) is judged in SQ-VTD8-03's check row below
